From 8b1d1c451b15560f4269e902662cb68db2331f2b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Long Luu <long.luu.ur@renesas.com>
Date: Thu, 7 Apr 2022 16:52:54 +0700
Subject: [PATCH 10/20] drivers: pwm: Add choosing POEG via sysfs

POEG and reset counter for GPT counting now
using the same input pin. Reset counter pin now can choose
which pin is used via sysfs. This patch add
choosing POEG via sysfs, this help user don't
need to rebuild device tree when switch POEG.

Signed-off-by: Long Luu <long.luu.ur@renesas.com>
Signed-off-by: Au Dang <au.dang.jx@renesas.com>
---
 drivers/pwm/gpt-rzg2l.c | 186 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++---------
 1 file changed, 146 insertions(+), 40 deletions(-)

